<p>You breathe a wave of deathly miasma in a cone of radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9.</acronym> Any target caught in the area will take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">168, 217, 254, 285, 311</acronym> darkness damage over 4 turns and receive either a bane of confusion or a bane of blindness for 4 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Magic, and the critical chance is based on your Spell crit rate.</p>